  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.0: VectorFilter fluent API — replace MetadataMatch dictionary and static factory methods (ByMetadata, ByNamespace, ByScope) with a full operator-based fluent builder (Where/WhereNot/WhereIn/WhereNotIn/WhereGreaterThan/WhereLessThan/WhereLike/WhereExists/WhereNotExists/And/Or). Introduces FilterCondition, MetadataCondition, FilterGroup, FilterOperator, and FilterLogic types.",
